# EngineLab Aircooled-like 3.6 Flat-6: 3 s holds at throttle 0.5, with 0.5 s
# sweeps between them. The EngineLab render is
# reference/enginelab/scenarios/holds-t050.json without its 6.5 s pre-roll.
hold 780 0.5 3
sweep 780 2000 0.5 0.5
hold 2000 0.5 3
sweep 2000 3000 0.5 0.5
hold 3000 0.5 3
sweep 3000 4000 0.5 0.5
hold 4000 0.5 3
sweep 4000 5000 0.5 0.5
hold 5000 0.5 3
sweep 5000 6000 0.5 0.5
hold 6000 0.5 3
sweep 6000 7000 0.5 0.5
hold 7000 0.5 3
